# Build-time artifacts of this app, none of them source.
#
# autoconf/ is the engine's build configuration: the app Makefile generates a
# .config and wanted-autoconf.h here on every build, from the engine's own
# Kconfig.engine. engine/ and wamr/ are symlinks into the engine checkout,
# created by the engine's test/nuttx-sim.sh so kbuild can reach those sources.
#
# The engine's script also writes these into .git/info/exclude, but that is
# per-clone and only applies once the script has run; committing them here is
# what makes a fresh checkout clean.
/autoconf/
/engine
/wamr
